---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile, projects } from '../data/site';
import { href } from '../data/paths';
---
<Base title="关于" active="about"><div class="container page-content"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> THE PERSON BEHIND THE CODE</p><h1>你好，<span class="accent">我是 BK。</span></h1><p>全栈开发工程师，开源工具的构建者。</p></header><div class="about-grid"><aside class="profile-card"><img src={profile.avatar} width="112" height="112" alt="BK 的 GitHub 头像"/><h2>{profile.name}</h2><p class="mono">@{profile.handle}</p><a class="button button-primary" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 主页 ↗</a></aside><div class="about-copy"><section><span class="eyebrow">01 / THIS SPACE</span><h2>一个存放代码与思考的地方</h2><p>{profile.introduction}</p><p>这个网站以开源作品和个人介绍为主。项目从日常需求出发，笔记则偶尔记录构建过程中的想法。</p></section><section><span class="eyebrow">02 / PROJECTS</span><h2>从公开项目开始了解我</h2><ul class="about-projects">{projects.map(project => <li><a href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{project.name}<span>↗</span></a><p>{project.description}</p></li>)}</ul></section><section><span class="eyebrow">03 / STAY CONNECTED</span><h2>保持联系</h2><p>可以在 <a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> 查看我的公开项目，也欢迎从这里的 <a href={href('blog/')}>主页</a> 开始了解。</p></section></div></div></div></Base>
